Let's expand the powers for $\greenD{6^5}=\blueD{6^x}\cdot\purpleD{6^4}$.

$\begin{align}
&=\blueD{\underbrace{}_{x\text{ times}}}\cdot\purpleD{\underbrace{6\cdot6\cdot6\cdot6    }_\text{4 times}}
\\\\\\
&=\greenD{\underbrace{6\cdot 6\cdot 6\cdot 6\cdot 6}_\text{5 times}}
\\\\
\end{align}$
